  id: OldMossTroll
  displayName: Old Moss Troll
  description: A troll as old as the hills, walking its round through the Misty Woods. Its eyes are weak, but it smells you long before it sees you and hears every step. Best avoided; if you must fight, its blows are slow but they break bones. It carries trollstone.
