  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c83dc226c90a6fc49b9a7188291c7e91, type: 3}
  journalLore: A troll as old as the hills, walking its round through Troll Valley with moss on its back and a tree on its shoulders. Its eyes are weak, but it smells you long before it sees you and hears every step.
  journalAdvice: Best avoided. You can feel it coming through the ground, so step off its round and let it pass. If you must fight, expect wide sweeps and a stomp that reaches all around it, and only hit it from behind once it is staggered. Being heard calling its kin is a good reason to leave.
  journalHabitat: Troll Valley, on the same round it has always walked
  journalKillsToKnow: 1
